#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:4
msgid "v3.3.1"
msgstr "v3.3.1"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.3.1 is a small release: it adds a **BNO055** library for the IMU shield "
"and fixes the H7 JPEG encoder boundaries and the CMSIS-NN enum sizes. It "
"introduces **no breaking API changes** — v3.3.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v3.3.1 je malo izdanje: dodaje biblioteku **BNO055** za IMU shield i "
"ispravlja granice H7 JPEG enkodera te veličine CMSIS-NN enuma. Ne uvodi "
"**nikakve nekompatibilne promjene API-ja** — skripte za v3.3.0 rade "
"nepromijenjeno."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:13
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:16
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:18
msgid "**BNO055 library** for the IMU shield."
msgstr "**BNO055 biblioteka** za IMU shield."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:19
msgid "**Fixes** — H7 JPEG encoder boundaries and CMSIS-NN enum sizes."
msgstr "**Ispravci** — granice H7 JPEG enkodera i veličine CMSIS-NN enuma."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:20
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v3.3.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Nikakve nekompatibilne promjene API-ja** — ponovno flešajte i vaše skripte"
" za v3.3.0 rade nepromijenjeno."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:24
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:26
msgid "Added a :mod:`bno055` library for the IMU shield."
msgstr "Dodana je biblioteka :mod:`bno055` za IMU shield."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:29
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:31
msgid "Fixed the H7 JPEG encoder boundaries and the CMSIS-NN enum sizes."
msgstr "Ispravljene su granice H7 JPEG enkodera i veličine CMSIS-NN enuma."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:34
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Nekompatibilne promjene API-ja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.3.1.rst:36
msgid ""
"v3.3.1 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v3.3.0 run unchanged on v3.3.1 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v3.3.1 ne uvodi **nikakve nekompatibilne promjene Python API-ja**\\ . "
"Skripte koje su radile na v3.3.0 rade nepromijenjeno na v3.3.1 — samo "
"ponovno flešajte firmware."
